    "system_id": "US6598719B2",
    "description": "US6598719B2 belt-type one-way clutch comprising first and second rotation members, a belt looped between the pulley and rocking member working surfaces, and a shaft-supported rocking member biased to tension one belt span; support members at the shaft ends disperse load at the case bores.",
    "version": "1.0",
    "lifecycle_stage": "concept",
    "domain": "Mechanical power transmission",
    "maturity": "draft",
    "date_modified": "2026-09-27"
